He.

00:18:51.960 --> 00:18:53.520 line:100%
It's warm. He just left.

00:18:53.600 --> 00:18:54.480 line:100%
Walkie-talkie.

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:57.600 line:100%
Ma Qiang.

00:18:58.440 --> 00:18:59.600 line:100%
Do you see Wu Shanlong?

00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:02.080 line:100%
<i>Sir, I didn't see him. No.</i>

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:05.680 line:100%
Qiao, do you see Wu Shanlong over there?

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:08.240 line:100%
<i>Ran, we didn't see him, either.</i>

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:21.120 line:100%
Wu Shanlong might be
in the underground parking lot.

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:23.560 line:100%
Ran, take the elevator

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:25.880 line:100%
and go outside. Intercept him
at the parking lot entrance.

00:19:25.960 --> 00:19:27.840 line:100%
I'll go after him using the stairs.
We'll corner him.

00:19:30.280 --> 00:19:32.160 line:100%
Is there anything I can help with?

00:20:17.280 --> 00:20:19.120 line:100%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:29.800 line:100%
Get lost.

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:38.880 line:100%
Wu Shanlong!

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:40.960 line:100%
Stop!

00:20:53.800 --> 00:20:54.640 line:100%
What the heck?

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:04.120 line:100%
Is this his car?

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:07.840 line:100%
He! He's here!

00:21:08.440 --> 00:21:11.040 line:100%
I've locked the door to the stairs!
Are there any more exits?

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:12.400 line:100%
The parking lot entrance.

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:15.760 line:100%
The parking lot entrance
was opened last week!

00:21:15.840 --> 00:21:17.960 line:100%
He might be able to exit from there!

00:21:20.400 --> 00:21:21.440 line:100%
Stop!

00:21:22.520 --> 00:21:23.560 line:100%
Catch him!

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:28.640 line:100%
Move! Move!

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:30.840 line:100%
Move!

00:21:30.920 --> 00:21:32.400 line:100%
What are you doing?

00:21:33.440 --> 00:21:34.360 line:100%
He went that way!

00:22:25.560 --> 00:22:26.680 line:100%
After him!

00:23:40.520 --> 00:23:41.520 line:100%
He!

00:23:43.840 --> 00:23:44.760 line:100%
He!

00:23:47.760 --> 00:23:48.840 line:100%
He!

00:23:54.120 --> 00:23:54.960 line:100%
He!

00:23:58.720 --> 00:24:00.200 line:100%
Quick, call an ambulance!

00:24:01.320 --> 00:24:02.920 line:100%
Stay awake, He!

00:24:07.640 --> 00:24:08.480 line:100%
He!

00:24:09.880 --> 00:24:11.160 line:100%
Stay awake, He!

00:24:20.800 --> 00:24:22.120 line:100%
He!

00:24:53.920 --> 00:24:55.880 line:100%
The steel rod pierced his lung

00:24:55.960 --> 00:24:57.200 line:100%
and broke his rib.

00:24:57.880 --> 00:25:00.160 line:100%
Thankfully, Officer He is lucky.

00:25:00.240 --> 00:25:01.160 line:100%
A few centimeters above,

00:25:02.400 --> 00:25:04.000 line:100%
and it'd have pierced his heart.

00:25:04.080 --> 00:25:05.680 line:100%
The consequences could've been worse.

00:25:06.680 --> 00:25:09.040 line:100%
You must do your best to treat him.

00:25:09.720 --> 00:25:11.720 line:100%
There mustn't be any complications.

00:25:12.320 --> 00:25:15.400 line:100%
He is the hero of the police force.

00:25:15.480 --> 00:25:16.400 line:100%
Don't worry.

00:25:17.280 --> 00:25:18.400 line:100%
Thank you.

00:25:27.320 --> 00:25:28.240 line:100%
Sir!

00:25:31.320 --> 00:25:32.240 line:100%
Sir!

00:25:36.040 --> 00:25:37.000 line:100%
Sir!

00:25:43.200 --> 00:25:44.800 line:100%
Are you all right, sir?

00:25:54.200 --> 00:25:55.080 line:100%
He.

00:25:58.960 --> 00:26:01.560 line:100%
He. Are you all right, He?

00:26:08.120 --> 00:26:08.960 line:20%
FOLDER

00:26:10.560 --> 00:26:12.360 line:100%
-Be careful.
-Be careful.

00:26:17.880 --> 00:26:18.960 line:100%
Dad.

00:26:22.480 --> 00:26:23.520 line:100%
I'm fine.

00:26:25.360 --> 00:26:26.200 line:100%
Are you really fine?

00:26:27.120 --> 00:26:29.120 line:100%
I said I'm fine.

00:26:33.920 --> 00:26:34.880 line:100%
Anyway, He,

00:26:34.960 --> 00:26:38.080 line:100%
why did you suddenly think
of bringing Xiaohe

00:26:38.160 --> 00:26:40.080 line:100%
to Yuanlongli's internet cafe
to search for clues?

00:26:41.360 --> 00:26:43.400 line:100%
Ran brought us there.

00:26:53.960 --> 00:26:54.800 line:100%
Ran.

00:26:54.880 --> 00:26:57.120 line:100%
Don't just stand there.

00:26:57.640 --> 00:26:59.160 line:100%
Tell everyone about it.

00:27:01.000 --> 00:27:01.880 line:100%
No way.

00:27:07.000 --> 00:27:08.280 line:100%
Yes.

00:27:08.360 --> 00:27:10.440 line:100%
Did you hear what he just said?

00:27:12.400 --> 00:27:15.560 line:100%
I… What did he just say?

00:27:15.640 --> 00:27:17.640 line:100%
Stop playing dumb.

00:27:19.800 --> 00:27:21.040 line:100%
He was scolding you.

00:27:21.120 --> 00:27:23.320 line:100%
He said you were biased towards Qu Dahai.

00:27:23.920 --> 00:27:25.880 line:100%
Xiaohe found the lead,

00:27:26.480 --> 00:27:28.320 line:100%
but you gave Qu Dahai the case

00:27:28.400 --> 00:27:30.800 line:100%
and even stopped Xiaohe
from joining the task force.

00:27:30.880 --> 00:27:34.000 line:100%
Is the criminal department
trying to steal credit too?

00:27:34.520 --> 00:27:35.320 line:100%
Captain,

00:27:35.400 --> 00:27:36.960 line:100%
I did it for Xiaohe's sake.

00:27:37.040 --> 00:27:40.120 line:100%
Wasn't Xiaohe kidnapped
when she was a child?

00:27:40.200 --> 00:27:42.080 line:100%
I was afraid that she
might relive those memories

00:27:42.160 --> 00:27:43.360 line:100%
after joining the task force.

00:27:43.440 --> 00:27:45.920 line:100%
What if it triggered… What you call it…

00:27:46.000 --> 00:27:48.560 line:100%
Hush. I can't hear him.

00:27:55.720 --> 00:27:56.560 line:100%
You hear that?

00:27:56.640 --> 00:27:57.880 line:100%
He's scolding you.

00:27:58.640 --> 00:27:59.480 line:100%
Are you talking to me?

00:27:59.560 --> 00:28:01.400 line:100%
Captain Ran said

00:28:01.480 --> 00:28:04.040 line:100%
the internet cafe owner you arrested

00:28:04.120 --> 00:28:06.920 line:100%
wasn't a kidnapping suspect.

00:28:07.000 --> 00:28:09.560 line:100%
You are only wasting your time
by interrogating him.

00:28:09.640 --> 00:28:13.720 line:100%
Also, Ran taught you
the Tremaux Algorithm.

00:28:13.800 --> 00:28:15.920 line:100%
Shouldn't you provide guidance
to Xiaohe now?

00:28:19.560 --> 00:28:20.840 line:100%
Dad,

00:28:20.920 --> 00:28:22.960 line:100%
you've had a long day.

00:28:23.040 --> 00:28:23.880 line:100%
Let's go home.

00:28:25.120 --> 00:28:27.560 line:100%
Uncle Ran still has a train to catch.

00:28:49.480 --> 00:28:50.320 line:100%
He Xiaohe.

00:28:51.200 --> 00:28:52.040 line:100%
Yes.

00:28:52.960 --> 00:28:54.240 line:100%
As long as you won't affect

00:28:54.760 --> 00:28:56.840 line:100%
the Special Task Force's investigation,

00:28:56.920 --> 00:28:57.880 line:100%
I will give you special permission

00:28:57.960 --> 00:28:59.640 line:100%
to assist in the investigation
of Han Zi'ang's case.

00:29:00.400 --> 00:29:02.120 line:100%
However, you must report all your actions

00:29:02.200 --> 00:29:03.840 line:100%
to the team leader of the task force.

00:29:06.680 --> 00:29:07.720 line:100%
Thank you, Captain.

00:29:07.800 --> 00:29:09.240 line:100%
-Hold on…
-Enough.

00:29:11.520 --> 00:29:13.720 line:100%
Captain, many parents are outside.

00:29:23.560 --> 00:29:25.760 line:100%
I'm warning you. Don't pull
this trick often in the future.

00:29:41.240 --> 00:29:42.800 line:100%
Train harder

00:29:43.640 --> 00:29:45.600 line:100%
if you want to outwit me.

00:30:35.160 --> 00:30:36.720 line:100%
CRIMINAL DEPARTMENT OFFICE

00:31:00.840 --> 00:31:01.680 line:100%
He.

00:31:04.800 --> 00:31:06.760 line:100%
He. You're awake.

00:31:06.840 --> 00:31:09.720 line:100%
-Let me call a doctor.
-Wait. There's no rush.

00:31:10.720 --> 00:31:12.080 line:100%
Water.

00:31:23.880 --> 00:31:24.760 line:100%
Right away.

00:31:34.240 --> 00:31:35.240 line:100%
How's that?

00:31:43.040 --> 00:31:44.000 line:100%
Here.

00:31:49.640 --> 00:31:50.600 line:100%
Brat,

00:31:51.240 --> 00:31:52.520 line:100%
are you trying to scald me?

00:31:53.640 --> 00:31:54.640 line:100%
Let me add some cold water.

00:31:54.720 --> 00:31:56.040 line:100%
No need.

00:31:57.440 --> 00:31:59.600 line:100%
-Then, I'll go and find a doctor.
-Wait.

00:32:01.920 --> 00:32:02.760 line:100%
Talk to me about the case.

00:32:04.520 --> 00:32:05.840 line:100%
Where's Wu Shanlong?

00:32:07.120 --> 00:32:08.640 line:100%
He was pierced by steel rods

00:32:08.720 --> 00:32:10.760 line:100%
and couldn't be resuscitated. He is dead.

00:32:17.520 --> 00:32:20.800 line:100%
The people in the forensic department
found a small amount

00:32:20.880 --> 00:32:22.880 line:100%
of human bone samples
in the bathroom's drain.

00:32:23.520 --> 00:32:24.960 line:100%
After examination,

00:32:25.040 --> 00:32:27.680 line:100%
it matches the DNA
found on Xu Zhihong's hair

00:32:27.760 --> 00:32:28.600 line:100%
collected at Xu's apartment.

00:32:29.440 --> 00:32:30.360 line:100%
Moreover,

00:32:30.440 --> 00:32:32.960 line:100%
the skin samples found in the blue heels

00:32:33.040 --> 00:32:34.800 line:100%
also match Xu Meng's DNA.

00:32:34.880 --> 00:32:36.920 line:100%
Combined with Wu Zhengxiong's

00:32:37.000 --> 00:32:38.800 line:100%
and Hu Anping's testimony…

00:32:38.880 --> 00:32:40.800 line:100%
In 1997, Wu Shanlong

00:32:40.880 --> 00:32:42.240 line:100%
hired Wolfie to murder someone.

00:32:42.320 --> 00:32:43.760 line:100%
Wu Shanlong said

00:32:44.280 --> 00:32:47.160 line:100%
he went and did the deed himself.

00:32:47.880 --> 00:32:48.760 line:100%
We can basically confirm

00:32:49.840 --> 00:32:52.080 line:100%
that Wu Shanlong is the murderer
of Xu Meng and her father.

00:32:54.080 --> 00:32:55.040 line:100%
Are there any accomplices?

00:32:55.840 --> 00:32:56.760 line:100%
None has been found at the moment.

00:32:59.040 --> 00:32:59.960 line:100%
What about the motive?

00:33:00.880 --> 00:33:03.120 line:100%
According to the information
we have currently,

00:33:03.200 --> 00:33:06.240 line:100%
my guess is that Wu Shanlong
had a strong urge to control women

00:33:06.320 --> 00:33:08.760 line:100%
due to his physiological defect.

00:33:08.840 --> 00:33:10.960 line:100%
He visited the foot massage parlor
frequently with Song Qingsong.

00:33:11.040 --> 00:33:13.800 line:100%
<i>He had his eyes on Xu Meng</i>
<i>and wanted her to himself.</i>

00:33:13.880 --> 00:33:14.720 line:100%
MUSE FOOT MASSAGE

00:33:14.800 --> 00:33:16.520 line:100%
<i>After Song Qingsong decided</i>
<i>to hire him to murder the victims,</i>

00:33:17.360 --> 00:33:19.280 line:100%
<i>Wu Shanlong lied</i>
<i>and used Wolfie as a scapegoat.</i>

00:33:19.360 --> 00:33:21.880 line:100%
<i>He then purposely helped</i>
<i>Xu Meng and her father</i>

00:33:21.960 --> 00:33:24.440 line:100%
<i>to disappear to escape debt.</i>

00:33:24.520 --> 00:33:27.640 line:100%
<i>Xu Meng thought Wu Shanlong</i>
<i>helped her out of kindness.</i>

00:33:27.720 --> 00:33:29.840 line:100%
<i>To her surprise, he was actually trying</i>
<i>to take her by force</i>

00:33:29.920 --> 00:33:31.000 line:100%
<i>after she successfully escaped.</i>

00:33:31.600 --> 00:33:34.000 line:100%
Wu Shanlong faced resistance
from Xu Meng and her father,

00:33:34.080 --> 00:33:37.040 line:100%
and he was afraid of Song Qingsong
finding out about his plan.

00:33:37.120 --> 00:33:38.440 line:100%
In the end,

00:33:39.440 --> 00:33:40.680 line:100%
he killed them both.

00:33:48.840 --> 00:33:50.120 line:100%
Unfortunately,

00:33:51.440 --> 00:33:53.320 line:100%
we couldn't find Xu Meng's body.

00:33:56.920 --> 00:34:02.920 line:100%
NANSHAN BRANCH
BUILDING NO. 1, INPATIENT DEPARTMENT

00:34:10.479 --> 00:34:11.320 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:34:13.760 --> 00:34:14.800 line:100%
Xiaohe!

00:34:32.039 --> 00:34:33.120 line:100%
Mrs. He,

00:34:33.200 --> 00:34:34.600 line:100%
you're right on time.

00:34:34.680 --> 00:34:35.720 line:100%
He just woke up.

00:34:40.320 --> 00:34:41.160 line:100%
Take a seat.

00:34:58.320 --> 00:34:59.240 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:35:09.680 --> 00:35:10.920 line:100%
I've not seen you for ages.

00:35:11.840 --> 00:35:12.760 line:100%
You've lost weight.

00:35:14.520 --> 00:35:16.040 line:100%
You are in such bad shape.

00:35:16.120 --> 00:35:17.120 line:100%
It's fine.

00:35:18.000 --> 00:35:19.160 line:100%
Just a minor wound.

00:35:23.160 --> 00:35:24.000 line:100%
Xiaohe,

00:35:24.720 --> 00:35:27.400 line:100%
I've achieved something huge this time.

00:35:27.480 --> 00:35:31.160 line:100%
The criminal used a steel rod this long
to stab me at this place,

00:35:31.840 --> 00:35:33.960 line:100%
and I didn't even let out a groan.

00:35:34.040 --> 00:35:36.240 line:100%
I even beat up the criminal.

00:35:40.120 --> 00:35:42.960 line:100%
So you risked your life
just to achieve something.

00:35:43.680 --> 00:35:45.240 line:100%
You are no longer young.

00:35:45.320 --> 00:35:46.680 line:100%
In the future,

00:35:47.360 --> 00:35:49.280 line:100%
you must take good care of yourself.

00:36:26.120 --> 00:36:27.560 line:100%
I've talked to you about this.

00:36:40.400 --> 00:36:42.080 line:20%
DIVORCE AGREEMENT

00:36:47.240 --> 00:36:49.120 line:100%
Our marriage has become like this

00:36:49.640 --> 00:36:51.080 line:100%
for a while now.

00:36:51.960 --> 00:36:53.880 line:100%
It's bad for everyone if this goes on.

00:36:55.200 --> 00:36:56.760 line:100%
Why not just let it go

00:36:57.520 --> 00:36:58.640 line:100%
and end it cleanly?

00:37:09.160 --> 00:37:11.640 line:100%
Actually, I've been trying to talk
to you about this.

00:37:12.640 --> 00:37:14.120 line:100%
But I've been busy with the investigation.

00:37:16.160 --> 00:37:17.000 line:100%
Give me a pen.

00:37:39.720 --> 00:37:42.880 line:20%
HUSBAND'S SIGNATURE
WIFE'S SIGNATURE: SUN YUN

00:37:47.120 --> 00:37:48.160 line:100%
What's wrong?

00:37:51.400 --> 00:37:54.560 line:100%
CUSTODY OF THE CHILD, HE XIAOHE
GOES TO THE WIFE

00:37:56.280 --> 00:37:58.640 line:100%
I'll soon transfer
to the provincial headquarters.

00:37:58.720 --> 00:37:59.840 line:100%
I'll bring Xiaohe with me.

00:37:59.920 --> 00:38:03.040 line:100%
This is better for her.
Look at you right now.

00:38:03.120 --> 00:38:05.120 line:100%
How can you even take care of her?

00:38:09.680 --> 00:38:12.320 line:100%
Xiaohe is becoming more rebellious now.

00:38:12.400 --> 00:38:13.840 line:100%
If she stays here,

00:38:13.920 --> 00:38:16.480 line:100%
it won't be too long
until she goes astray.

00:38:17.480 --> 00:38:19.400 line:100%
You don't need to pay alimony.

00:38:19.920 --> 00:38:21.880 line:100%
I can support her on my own.

00:38:21.960 --> 00:38:23.440 line:100%
If you miss her,

00:38:23.520 --> 00:38:25.640 line:100%
you may visit her at any time.
I won't stop you.

00:38:30.240 --> 00:38:31.640 line:100%
Do you hear me?

00:38:33.400 --> 00:38:34.400 line:100%
He Yuanhang.

00:38:36.560 --> 00:38:38.120 line:100%
He Yuanhang!

00:38:41.280 --> 00:38:42.840 line:100%
I don't object to the divorce.

00:38:43.360 --> 00:38:46.240 line:100%
We all want to seek happiness,
and I have nothing to say about that.

00:38:46.320 --> 00:38:47.840 line:100%
Don't use me as an excuse in the future.

00:38:47.920 --> 00:38:50.040 line:100%
I'm sick of hearing,
"It's for Xiaohe's sake."

00:38:51.280 --> 00:38:52.920 line:100%
I'll decide how I live my life.

00:38:53.440 --> 00:38:54.280 line:100%
I'm not going to the provincial capital.

00:38:54.360 --> 00:38:57.320 line:100%
Xiaohe. The adults are talking.
Don't cause any trouble.

00:38:57.960 --> 00:38:59.920 line:100%
The adults also shouldn't cause
any trouble for the child.

00:39:00.000 --> 00:39:01.480 line:100%
The schools in the provincial capital
are so much better

00:39:01.560 --> 00:39:02.600 line:100%
than the ones in Weiyang.

00:39:02.680 --> 00:39:05.720 line:100%
Attending university or studying abroad
will be so much easier in the future.

00:39:05.800 --> 00:39:07.800 line:100%
Don't you like music?

00:39:07.880 --> 00:39:10.240 line:100%
England. The United States. France.

00:39:10.320 --> 00:39:12.000 line:100%
No matter where you want to go,
I'll also support you.

00:39:12.080 --> 00:39:13.480 line:100%
I don't need anyone to decide for me.

00:39:13.560 --> 00:39:15.760 line:100%
He Xiaohe. I am your guardian.

00:39:15.840 --> 00:39:17.000 line:100%
As long as you are still a minor,

00:39:17.080 --> 00:39:19.280 line:100%
you need my consent
before you make your decisions.

00:39:19.360 --> 00:39:20.520 line:100%
This is non-negotiable.

00:39:20.600 --> 00:39:22.800 line:100%
If that's the case,
it's also non-negotiable for me.

00:39:22.880 --> 00:39:23.840 line:100%
I'm following Dad.

00:39:24.760 --> 00:39:27.600 line:100%
Look at her. She's really stubborn,

00:39:27.680 --> 00:39:29.920 line:100%
just like you.
She won't be able to turn good.

00:39:51.640 --> 00:39:53.920 line:20%
CUSTODY OF THE CHILD, HE XIAOHE
GOES TO THE HUSBAND

00:40:04.400 --> 00:40:08.000 line:20%
HUSBAND'S SIGNATURE: HE

00:40:31.800 --> 00:40:33.720 line:100%
What is it? You don't want her to leave?

00:40:37.560 --> 00:40:40.200 line:100%
Xiaohe, I have raised an amazing daughter.

00:40:40.800 --> 00:40:42.480 line:100%
-Give me a hug.
-Don't be so full of yourself.

00:40:42.560 --> 00:40:45.360 line:100%
Not leaving with Mom
has nothing to do with you.

00:40:46.520 --> 00:40:47.360 line:100%
What do you mean?

00:40:47.440 --> 00:40:50.080 line:100%
My friends, my band,

00:40:50.160 --> 00:40:51.240 line:100%
and my rock career are all in Weiyang.

00:40:51.320 --> 00:40:52.600 line:100%
Listen now.

00:40:52.680 --> 00:40:54.360 line:100%
Leave me alone in the future.

00:40:54.440 --> 00:40:55.920 line:100%
But I am your only parent now.

00:40:56.000 --> 00:40:57.200 line:100%
You don't agree?

00:40:57.720 --> 00:40:59.600 line:100%
Mom just left.
I'll call her back right away.

00:40:59.680 --> 00:41:01.120 line:100%
I agree.

00:41:05.400 --> 00:41:06.480 line:100%
I agree.

00:41:07.480 --> 00:41:08.600 line:100%
Take good care of yourself.

00:41:09.680 --> 00:41:11.040 line:100%
I still have lessons in the afternoon.

00:42:26.200 --> 00:42:30.280 line:100%
Family is a strange thing.

00:42:33.080 --> 00:42:35.200 line:100%
If the family is intact,

00:42:36.440 --> 00:42:38.200 line:100%
people dig it

00:42:40.320 --> 00:42:42.560 line:100%
until there's a hole.

00:42:43.600 --> 00:42:44.880 line:100%
If it isn't intact,

00:42:47.120 --> 00:42:48.800 line:100%
people will do their best to repair it.

00:42:50.400 --> 00:42:51.440 line:100%
They will even

00:42:52.320 --> 00:42:55.320 line:100%
do something as stupid
as repairing a golden bowl

00:42:56.400 --> 00:42:57.440 line:100%
with a piece of tile.

00:43:26.640 --> 00:43:27.760 line:100%
What is it?

00:43:28.800 --> 00:43:29.600 line:100%
Take a guess.

00:43:32.800 --> 00:43:33.640 line:100%
No.

00:43:43.000 --> 00:43:45.280 line:100%
CERTIFICATE OF HONOR

00:43:45.360 --> 00:43:46.560 line:100%
"In the June 30th case,

00:43:46.640 --> 00:43:49.880 line:100%
Officer He Yuanhang demonstrated
keen investigative thinking,

00:43:49.960 --> 00:43:52.960 line:100%
exceptional judgment,
a strong sense of responsibility,

00:43:53.040 --> 00:43:55.040 line:100%
and extensive investigative experience.

00:43:55.120 --> 00:43:57.840 line:100%
He made significant contributions
in solving the case.

00:43:59.840 --> 00:44:01.840 line:20%
To commend his exemplary performance
and promote integrity,

00:44:01.920 --> 00:44:03.280 line:100%
in accordance
with the People's Police Rewards

00:44:03.360 --> 00:44:04.720 line:100%
and Punishments Regulations,

00:44:04.800 --> 00:44:06.400 line:100%
it is submitted to the Provincial
Public Security Department

00:44:06.480 --> 00:44:09.880 line:100%
that Officer He Yuanhang should be awarded
a second-class individual merit."

00:44:17.280 --> 00:44:19.960 line:100%
The police station specifically
requested me to give it to you in person.

00:44:22.320 --> 00:44:24.920 line:100%
SECOND-CLASS MERIT MEDAL
OF THE MINISTRY OF PUBLIC SECURITY OF PRC

00:44:28.760 --> 00:44:30.760 line:100%
NAME: HE YUANHANG
MEDAL: SECOND-CLASS MERIT

00:44:35.240 --> 00:44:37.040 line:100%
I get custody of my daughter

00:44:38.440 --> 00:44:39.920 line:100%
and the second-class merit.

00:44:40.800 --> 00:44:41.920 line:100%
Let's see

00:44:42.880 --> 00:44:44.240 line:100%
who dares call me
a good-for-nothing again.

00:44:47.600 --> 00:44:50.400 line:100%
What are you doing?
I'm not done admiring it.

00:44:55.960 --> 00:44:57.360 line:100%
Once you recover,

00:44:57.440 --> 00:44:59.320 line:100%
you must take your medications
for your condition on time.

00:44:59.400 --> 00:45:01.480 line:100%
It's time to quit drinking cola.

00:45:01.560 --> 00:45:03.600 line:100%
The same goes for cigarettes,
alcohol, and fatty meat.

00:45:04.200 --> 00:45:06.920 line:100%
-The doctor even mentioned to--
-Enough.

00:45:07.000 --> 00:45:09.640 line:100%
Stop nagging beside me. All right?

00:45:09.720 --> 00:45:10.800 line:100%
You're so annoying.

00:45:11.320 --> 00:45:13.600 line:100%
Go back and keep working, Deputy Captain.

00:45:29.840 --> 00:45:30.920 line:100%
He.

00:45:31.000 --> 00:45:33.160 line:100%
If you didn't push me away,

00:45:33.240 --> 00:45:36.800 line:100%
I'd probably be the one lying here now.

00:45:39.000 --> 00:45:42.840 line:100%
I told you not to nag. All right?

00:45:44.840 --> 00:45:46.080 line:100%
Do you think I did it for you?

00:45:47.840 --> 00:45:49.480 line:100%
I did it for myself.

00:45:49.560 --> 00:45:51.760 line:100%
If I let my apprentice get hurt,

00:45:51.840 --> 00:45:54.920 line:100%
it'll only make me look bad
as your mentor.

00:45:55.000 --> 00:45:56.600 line:100%
It shows how incapable I am.

00:45:57.200 --> 00:45:58.600 line:100%
Go away.

00:45:59.480 --> 00:46:00.760 line:100%
Don't disturb my rest.

00:46:43.880 --> 00:46:44.840 line:100%
I'm leaving,

00:46:45.880 --> 00:46:46.760 line:100%
sir.